       >>SOURCE FORMAT FREE
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. P-42-EVALUATE-ALSO.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 A PIC 9 VALUE 2.
01 B PIC X VALUE "B".
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
EVALUATE A ALSO B
 WHEN 1 ALSO "A" DISPLAY "ONE-A"
 WHEN 2 ALSO "B" DISPLAY "TWO-B"
 WHEN OTHER DISPLAY "OTHER"
END-EVALUATE
STOP RUN.
